📋 Implementation Roadmap
Phase 1: Supabase Setup

Apply
1. Create Supabase project
2. Set up database tables (users, ledgers, transactions, categories)
3. Enable Row-Level Security (RLS)
4. Add authentication (Email/Password or Magic Link)
Phase 2: App Integration (1-2 days)

Apply
1. Install @supabase/supabase-js
2. Create Supabase client
3. Replace localStorage calls with Supabase queries
4. Add login/signup pages
5. Protect routes (redirect if not authenticated)
Phase 3: Offline Support (1-2 days)

Apply
1. Keep localStorage as cache
2. Sync to Supabase when online
3. Queue changes when offline
4. Resolve conflicts on reconnect
Phase 4: PWA & Mobile (1 day)

Apply
1. Add manifest.json
2. Service worker for offline
3. Install prompt for mobile
4. Test on actual devices
Phase 5: Share & Feedback (Ongoing)

Apply
1. Deploy to Vercel/Netlify
2. Send invites to friends
3. Collect feedback
4. Iterate based on usage
